{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Scalpel Neuro",
  "prompt": "surgical neuro mid-bass for 174 drum and bass: an FM and saw core folded, then a comb whose pitch steps every 1/16 note, squashed with multiband OTT over a clean mono sine sub; Morph goes from clean to snarling",
